{
  "sections": {
    "hero_main": {
      "type": "hero",
      "blocks": {
        "hero_text_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p style='color: #8b6b4a; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 12px;'>PERSONALIZED PET TEE · PET HAIR RESISTANT FABRIC</p>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte"
          }
        },
        "hero_text_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1>Finally, a Custom Pet Tee Made for Life With Your Pet.</h1>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "h1"
          }
        },
        "hero_text_3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Because loving your pet shouldn't mean wearing their fur everywhere.</p><ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;'><li>✓ Helps keep fur off most everyday surfaces</li><li>✓ Made with premium soft cotton blend</li><li>✓ Every tee is unique, created just for you</li></ul>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte"
          }
        },
        "hero_button": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Create Your Custom Tee",
            "link": "shopify://products/your-product-handle",
            "style_class": "button",
            "width": "fit-content"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["hero_text_1", "hero_text_2", "hero_text_3", "hero_button"],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "row",
        "vertical_on_mobile": true,
        "horizontal_alignment": "space-between",
        "vertical_alignment": "center",
        "section_height": "adapt",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 40,
        "padding-block-end": 40
      }
    },
    "problem_section": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "problem_image": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "width": "fill",
            "image_ratio": "adapt",
            "border_radius": 8
          }
        },
        "problem_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
            "vertical_alignment": "center",
            "gap": 16,
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 50
          },
          "blocks": {
            "problem_text": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p style='color: #8b6b4a; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 12px;'>THE PET PARENT PROBLEM</p><h2>You Love Your Pet. The Fur on Your Clothes? Not So Much.</h2><p>You put on a clean black tee. Your dog gives you that look. You know the fur is already on it. It happens every day—but with Zena Comme, the fit and the feeling help bring that pet parent hair problem down.</p><p>What if your favorite pet tee was made with those moments in mind?</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["problem_text"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["problem_image", "problem_group"],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "row",
        "vertical_on_mobile": true,
        "horizontal_alignment": "space-between",
        "vertical_alignment": "center",
        "gap": 32,
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 60,
        "padding-block-end": 60
      }
    },
    "benefits_section": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "benefits_header": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2 style='text-align: center;'>More Cuddles. Less Fur Drama.</h2><p style='text-align: center;'>You're going to cuddle them anyway, no matter how much fur they bring.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "padding-block-end": 32
          }
        },
        "card_group_1": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 33,
            "gap": 12,
            "padding-inline-end": 12
          },
          "blocks": {
            "card_img_1": { "type": "image", "settings": { "width": "fill", "image_ratio": "landscape" } },
            "card_text_1": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<h3>Cuddle Friendly</h3><p>Made for room for the moments that matter.</p>", "type_preset": "rte" } }
          },
          "block_order": ["card_img_1", "card_text_1"]
        },
        "card_group_2": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 33,
            "gap": 12,
            "padding-inline-start": 12,
            "padding-inline-end": 12
          },
          "blocks": {
            "card_img_2": { "type": "image", "settings": { "width": "fill", "image_ratio": "landscape" } },
            "card_text_2": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<h3>Brush Off Easier</h3><p>A smoother surface designed to make fur less clingy.</p>", "type_preset": "rte" } }
          },
          "block_order": ["card_img_2", "card_text_2"]
        },
        "card_group_3": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 33,
            "gap": 12,
            "padding-inline-start": 12
          },
          "blocks": {
            "card_img_3": { "type": "image", "settings": { "width": "fill", "image_ratio": "landscape" } },
            "card_text_3": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<h3>Wear It Everywhere</h3><p>From couch cuddles to coffee runs.</p>", "type_preset": "rte" } }
          },
          "block_order": ["card_img_3", "card_text_3"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["benefits_header", "card_group_1", "card_group_2", "card_group_3"],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "row",
        "vertical_on_mobile": true,
        "horizontal_alignment": "space-between",
        "vertical_alignment": "flex-start",
        "gap": 12,
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 60,
        "padding-block-end": 60
      }
    },
    "faq_section": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>A Few Things You Might Be Wondering</h2>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "padding-block-end": 24
          }
        },
        "faq_accordion": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "row_1": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": { "heading": "Does the shirt completely repel pet hair?", "open_by_default": false },
              "blocks": {
                "text_1": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<p>No. The fabric is smoother and more hair-resistant by construction, and smooth surfaces tend to release hair more easily. Results vary.</p>", "type_preset": "rte" } }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_1"]
            },
            "row_2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": { "heading": "How is it different from an ordinary custom tee?", "open_by_default": false },
              "blocks": {
                "text_2": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<p>Most custom tees focus on the print. Ours starts with the fabric and fit, then adds the print.</p>", "type_preset": "rte" } }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_2"]
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["row_1", "row_2"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["faq_heading", "faq_accordion"],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "column",
        "section_width": "narrow",
        "padding-block-start": 60,
        "padding-block-end": 60
      }
    },
    "bottom_cta": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "cta_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "horizontal_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment": "center",
            "gap": 24,
            "background_media": "image",
            "toggle_overlay": true,
            "overlay_color": "#00000080",
            "padding-block-start": 100,
            "padding-block-end": 100
          },
          "blocks": {
            "cta_text": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h2 style='color: white; text-align: center;'>They're More Than a Pet. They're Part of Your Everyday.</h2><p style='color: white; text-align: center;'>Because they're always part of your everyday, we'd like to make the clothes you wear feel more like a part of them, too.</p>",
                "alignment": "center",
                "type_preset": "rte"
              }
            },
            "cta_btn": {
              "type": "button",
              "settings": {
                "label": "Create My Custom Tee",
                "link": "shopify://products/your-product-handle",
                "style_class": "button"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["cta_text", "cta_btn"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["cta_group"],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "column",
        "section_width": "full-width"
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "hero_main",
    "problem_section",
    "benefits_section",
    "faq_section",
    "bottom_cta"
  ]
}
